<title>SPAIN: Spain's Santander ups '96 final dividend 11 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's Santander ups '96 final dividend 11 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish bank Santander will pay a 1996 final dividend of 100 pesetas on April 30, a statement said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>A statement note explained this 100 pesetas will add to three interim dividends already paid (at the end of July, October and July) for a total dividend of 310 pesetas, up 10.72 percent higher than the total for the previous year.</p>
<p>Santander shareholders' meeting will be held in Santander on March 22.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
